      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-07T05:01:14.637+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Though I really don't know enough about \"why\" this is a bad idea to judge if this applies to us and if namibj is correct.",
