      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Interesting! These came from @Andrew Wingate‘s original 1x1 design, which did have some issues with bubbles as I understand it. But we thought that was most likely due to the vias not being covered by soldermask on top.\nI don’t know if there’s a good reason why they are plated through holes instead of vias.",
