      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I think the offer of CoB bonding is normally only available if you use the standard template, though that does make it a bit strange that the bonding is the same price for quarter slot as I thought it was ~priced per bond. Worth checking with Tim though if you want to make your own CoB.",
