      "type": "Reply",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-07T08:00:54.715+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I don't think we've gotten any of the quarter slot yet so don't have good pricing info on it yet, and am not certain prices really have to do with number of bonds directly, it's just a helpful tool to get you in the ballpark. \nI'm also not certain we will be accepting *any* custom cob this time? Keep in mind the only custom ones last time shared the wirebonding layout, just had different traces and routing on the pcb.",
